---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Cain Macias — Systems, Software & Automation"
  description="The personal site of Cain Macias, an operations-minded systems builder working across enterprise software, integrations, and automation."
>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="site-name" href="/" aria-label="Cain Macias home">cain macias<span class="name-period">.</span></a>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="site-nav">
      <a href="/projects">work</a>
      <a href="/about">about</a>
      <a href="/gear">gear</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">south texas · systems & software</p>
    <h1 id="intro-title">hello, Cain here<span class="name-period">.</span></h1>
    <p class="intro-copy">
      I’m an operations-minded builder documenting what I learn while making business systems work better. Most of my time is spent somewhere between software, data, and the day-to-day problems people need technology to solve.
    </p>
    <p class="intro-copy muted-copy">
      By day, I work with enterprise tools and workflows. Outside of that, I build integrations, automate repetitive work, and keep learning about the systems behind the screen.
    </p>
    <div class="inline-links">
      <a href="mailto:cainmacias69@gmail.com">say hello <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="/projects">see what I’m building <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="now-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="now-title">now</h2>
      <span class="section-note">what I’m focused on</span>
    </div>
    <ul class="plain-list">
      <li>
        <span class="list-title">Enterprise systems</span>
        <span class="list-detail">Connecting ERP, CRM, pricing, and operations workflows so information moves with less manual effort.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="list-title">Automation & data</span>
        <span class="list-detail">Building Python tools for catalog cleanup, change detection, data validation, and repeatable reporting.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="list-title">Learning</span>
        <span class="list-detail">MBA candidate focused on business analytics and healthcare administration.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="work-title">selected work</h2>
      <a class="subtle-link" href="/projects">all projects ↗</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="work-list">
      <li>
        <a href="/projects/python-automation-engine">
          <span class="work-name">Python automation & reconciliation</span>
          <span class="work-meta">automation · data quality</span>
          <span class="work-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/projects/enterprise-migration">
          <span class="work-name">Enterprise system migration</span>
          <span class="work-meta">ETL · systems integration</span>
          <span class="work-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/projects/b2b-ordering-platform">
          <span class="work-name">B2B ordering platform</span>
          <span class="work-meta">Django · PostgreSQL · AWS</span>
          <span class="work-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section connect-section" aria-labelledby="connect-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="connect-title">around the web</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-copy">If you’re working on interesting systems, building something useful, or just want to talk shop, feel free to reach out.</p>
    <div class="inline-links">
      <a href="mailto:cainmacias69@gmail.com">email <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="https://github.com/BrownYumYum" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">linkedin <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <span>© 2026 Cain Macias</span>
    <span>made with curiosity in Texas</span>
  </footer>
</Layout>
